  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>싣<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>롷<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>빵<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qzYD_mvagFM?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>深深<rt>침ˉ침ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>換<rt>왈-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>情<rt>졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīm-chîm’e ai, oa̰-lî-bo-jiéng’e sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>제<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>男人<rt>람띤ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>痴情<rt>치ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>命運<rt>먀운ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jè kâm-si-lam-rín chī-jiéng mia-ūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>昔日<rt>셱ˆ띧ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>恩愛<rt>운ˉ애</rt></ruby> <ruby>情份<rt>졩훈ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siêk-rît’e ūn-ai jieng-hūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>如今<rt>뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>變成<rt>볜솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>傷痕<rt>셩ˉ훈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kàu-ru-kîm pien-sieng-siōng-hún\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心<rt>심ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>長<rt>등ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>情<rt>졩-</rt></ruby><ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>遠<rt>흥ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-lōr ya-tńg, jieng-lōr jiâh-hn̄g\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥人<rt>샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>安慰<rt>안ˉ위ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>寂寞<rt>셕ˆ뻑ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>靈魂<rt>롕훈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-siâ̰-láng ān-wī, gûn-siôrk-bôrk’e lieng-hún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>心<rt>심ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>酸<rt>승ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>怨恨<rt>완ˋ훈ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>後悔<rt>효훼ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>付<rt>후ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>青春<rt>촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà sīm-sn̂g, goà oàn-hūn, goà hio-huê-hù-chût-chiēng-chûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>失落<rt>싣ˆ롷ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>失落<rt>싣ˆ롷ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>夢<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā~ sît-lôh’e sîm, sît-lôh’e bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>深深<rt>침ˉ침ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>換<rt>왈-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>情<rt>졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīm-chîm’e ai, oa̰-lî-bo-jiéng’e sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>제<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>男人<rt>람띤ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>痴情<rt>치ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>命運<rt>먀운ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jè kâm-si-lam-rín chī-jiéng mia-ūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>昔日<rt>셱ˆ띧ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>恩愛<rt>운ˉ애</rt></ruby> <ruby>情份<rt>졩훈ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siêk-rît’e ūn-ai jieng-hūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>如今<rt>뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>變成<rt>볜솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>傷痕<rt>셩ˉ훈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kàu-ru-kîm pien-sieng-siōng-hún\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心<rt>심ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>長<rt>등ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>情<rt>졩-</rt></ruby><ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>遠<rt>흥ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-lōr ya-tńg, jieng-lōr jiâh-hn̄g\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥人<rt>샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>安慰<rt>안ˉ위ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>寂寞<rt>셕ˆ뻑ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>靈魂<rt>롕훈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-siâ̰-láng ān-wī, gûn-siôrk-bôrk’e lieng-hún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>心<rt>심ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>酸<rt>승ˆ</rt>